{
  "format": "Favorited dishes on a fetched menu (matchFavoritedDishes). kind=match: input {favorites, menuItems} -> [{dishName, hallTid, mealPeriod, date}]. Exact, case-sensitive, verbatim name match; only favorites with type 'dish' count; one result per (hall, favorited name), taking the first menu item for that name within the hall in menuItems order. Output order: halls by first appearance in menuItems, then favorited names in first-appearance order in favorites. Every case is {kind, name, input, expected}; expected is what shared/src (TypeScript) returns for input. JSON null = a value that is present and null. An ABSENT key = undefined / not set: implementations must treat a missing key and an unset field as the same thing, and must not emit null for it. Regenerate with `pnpm --filter @udine/shared vectors`; never hand-edit expected.",
